---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import photo from "../assets/judi1_square_small.jpeg";
---

<section id="hello" class="py-16 sm:py-24 reveal">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 md:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Bio -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 order-2 md:order-1">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-fg mb-6">
          Hello.
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            I've been writing code since the year we sang along to Bruno Mars's
            Grenade and Adele's Rolling in the Deep.
          </p>
          <p>
            Since then I've built full-stack web applications for startups and
            large organisations, earned an MSc in Mathematics, and eventually
            went freelance, which is a polite way of saying I opted out of the
            open-plan office.
          </p>
          <p>
            These days I work as a freelance frontend tech lead, mostly in
            JavaScript and TypeScript. I build the thing, and I make sure
            everyone else can build it too: architecture decisions, developer
            tooling, and a fair amount of translating between engineers and the
            people who need to understand what the engineers just said.
          </p>
          <p>
            I like the messy bit. Sometimes that's an early-stage product still
            taking shape, sometimes it's an established team carrying more chaos
            than it can hold.
          </p>
          <p>
            I'm active in Berlin's tech community: organising meetups for
            freelancers, speaking at events, and the occasional podcast
            appearance. The thread running through all of it is the human side
            of tech: careers, community, and finding a calm way of working in
            the chaotic tech industry.
          </p>
          <p class="italic">I read, I speak, I write, I code.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Photo -->
      <div
        class="md:col-span-1 order-1 md:order-2 flex justify-center md:justify-end"
      >
        <Image
          src={photo}
          alt="Judith Böhlert"
          width={600}
          height={600}
          class="w-48 h-48 md:w-full md:h-auto md:aspect-square rounded-2xl object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
